R("An open, offline, guideline-rule engine can interpret laboratory panels to the ceiling the first panel allows, reproduce population-screening performance across independent survey cycles and match a frontier LLM blind, while remaining auditable.",
"An open, offline, guideline-rule engine interpreted structured laboratory panels close to the ceiling the first panel allows, reproduced population-screening performance across independent survey cycles and was indistinguishable from a frontier LLM on a blinded paired primary metric, while remaining auditable.")
